{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightork Adventures 3</strong> brings back the fast-paced, explosive action of the Nightork series - now with deeper strategy and more destruction than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy is protected by <strong>three shields</strong>, and every shield has one of two colors: <strong>Magic</strong> or <strong>Antimagic</strong>. To destroy them, you must <strong>hit the correct colors in the right order</strong>\u00a0- precision and timing are everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>powerups</strong> to trigger massive explosions and chain reactions, and choose one of three <strong>Totems</strong> to shape your playstyle:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3b <strong>Ice Bear</strong> \u2013 Boosts defense and absorbs incoming damage. <br>\ud83d\udc05 <strong>Snow Tiger</strong> \u2013 Increases attack power and fire rate. <br>\ud83e\udd85 <strong>Frost Raven</strong> \u2013 Enhances mobility and special energy regeneration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of enemies across <strong>three unique arenas</strong>, each filled with intense battles, glowing projectiles, and spectacular effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic <strong>Magic/Antimagic</strong> shield system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three <strong>Totems</strong> with unique bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive <strong>powerups</strong> and chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three <strong>arenas</strong> packed with fast-paced action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style gameplay with a strategic twist</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the rhythm of destruction and survive the chaos?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Sphere completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4120590/e5676b8b64e7f8e1f0df86f36eadcdad4530a9d2.jpg"},{"name":"Hive completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4120590/f62b0cd274138d9e9ace0d93da727e5da35d0b43.jpg"},{"name":"Cave completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4120590/11dd2752c4959902fc9fe86966d585c5602578b5.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120590?t=1767703035","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120590?t=1767703035","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120590/225ca8770d4c9a455d13a085837cc602b850b7d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767703035","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120590/225ca8770d4c9a455d13a085837cc602b850b7d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767703035","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightork Adventures 3</strong> brings back the fast-paced, explosive action of the Nightork series - now with deeper strategy and more destruction than ever!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each enemy is protected by <strong>three shields</strong>, and every shield has one of two colors: <strong>Magic</strong> or <strong>Antimagic</strong>. To destroy them, you must <strong>hit the correct colors in the right order</strong>\u00a0- precision and timing are everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>powerups</strong> to trigger massive explosions and chain reactions, and choose one of three <strong>Totems</strong> to shape your playstyle:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3b <strong>Ice Bear</strong> \u2013 Boosts defense and absorbs incoming damage. <br>\ud83d\udc05 <strong>Snow Tiger</strong> \u2013 Increases attack power and fire rate. <br>\ud83e\udd85 <strong>Frost Raven</strong> \u2013 Enhances mobility and special energy regeneration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of enemies across <strong>three unique arenas</strong>, each filled with intense battles, glowing projectiles, and spectacular effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic <strong>Magic/Antimagic</strong> shield system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three <strong>Totems</strong> with unique bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive <strong>powerups</strong> and chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three <strong>arenas</strong> packed with fast-paced action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-style gameplay with a strategic twist</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you master the rhythm of destruction and survive the chaos?</p>","developers":[" Warptear Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120590/b385bc61448fcb22afa33788a2fe2b0bc907546d/header.jpg?t=1767703035","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4120590/2055480474/074d71786bea70c11f0e823324a62abb23c825e8/1764277771/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764279196","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4120590/205548047